                                                "example_id": "377d3cdc-4187-4b78-bca2-3a42ac18b525",
                                                "sense_id": "4c066787-1ebc-3d23-9150-40d095ed391d",
                                                "text": "\"The Pacers have kept millions of northerners on the move. But while they have served us well and provided some communities with rail services they may have otherwise lost, it is time to give them a well-earned rest,\" said Northern Regional Director Chris Jackson."
